  "title": "Auditory Streaming and Interoception",
  "description": "This dataset comprises auditory streaming and interoception data collected from human participants using electrophysiological recordings. The study investigates the relationship between auditory perceptual organization and interoceptive awareness, combining behavioral measures with neurophysiological recordings to examine how internal bodily signals influence auditory scene analysis.",
